{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1534214-nexusflamehart-ex3-craft-reweave","id":1534214,"title":"Nexusflamehart Ex3 Craft Reweave","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-14T15:25:35-07:00","id":1534214,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Nexusflamehart Ex3 Craft Reweave","content":"<br /> Practically everyone who has ever tried to make a craft focused character in Exalted 3e has, at some point, voiced complaints about how bad it is for any number of reasons.<br /> <br /> There are many things wrong with Core Craft and while I can't promise that the system below will fix all of those issues, I can say that it was made with the intentions of the Core system in mind so that it will require minimal relearning to understand.<br /> <br /> If you want a system that...<ul><li>Is streamlines and Naturally builds off the same blocks that several (better) systems in the Books use</li> <li>Is made to cater to any level of investment into craft from novice whittler to First Age Artisan</li> <li>Is made to include rules for creating Talismans, Alchemy, and even Expanded rules on Shipbuilding</li> <li>Is geared towards allowing players to use Craft as a Social and Exploration tool</li> <li>Includes a number of Example craft projects to inspire and serve as a basis for your own creativity.</li> </ul>Then my new system may be just what you're looking for.<br /> <br /> The project is now ready to be playtested and your opinions and commentary are what I need to take this from simply an acceptable replacement for one of the most promising, but worst implemented part of Third Edition.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1A8JxCcFJb4m2KawjyxcEfCzVgTK1v59103q4gJogIe4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=